=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 제출논문 조건 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">재학 중 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1편 이상 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2010년도 이후 입학자 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 재학 중 해외저명학술지에 1편 이상 주저자로 게재 또는 국내 전국규모</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">학술지에 2편 중 1편이상은 주저자로 게재된 논문)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 학술대회 발표 논문은 게재물이 아니므로 제출 시 확인 후 제출 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-fon